{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/c2a820d188c02698c49992bc453fa65f.avif?t=1761486319\" width=640 height=613 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A tale of Struggle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;..destiny won't stay idle as we fight it..&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/2ad7b82a5d22e7909aeef6097bd521f5.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 </strong><br><strong>In their hunger for immortality humanity fought &quot;Death the Aeon&quot; but the battle was lost.. their hope was shattered.. and a curse was cast upon them..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/a25a7315e45dc3bb82b9638da0e937d9.poster.avif?t=1761486319\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/a25a7315e45dc3bb82b9638da0e937d9.webm?t=1761486319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <strong><i>&quot;Seven Days, Seven nights,\u00a0no more no less than one life.. will be left in Your World..&quot;\u00a0\u00a0 </i>.. but one hope remains, hidden in Guardiah Tower..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds you will Play as each character. Day after day you will witness the events from their point of view as the road to salvation is threatened by dark forces and each protagonist has a crucial role to play. With the chosen entering Guardiah, a knight seeking hope, a mage looking for answers and the monsters rebelling to humanity, the story will keep you engaged till the very end.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/9ef679d2006529766f852aba8b592952.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Each protagonist has its own unique style and abilities and every level changes the way you play. From stealthy thieves to knights and mages, you will play as both humans and monsters. Each level will prompt you with different challenges with levels based on combat, stealth, speed, cleverness. An ever changing gameplay that will keep your playthrough always fresh. The field combat relies solely on your skills: no gear, no loot to praise, just your ability !   <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/5980eafbe0a105683e56c17290467f1e.poster.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/5980eafbe0a105683e56c17290467f1e.webm?t=1761486319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/5980eafbe0a105683e56c17290467f1e.mp4?t=1761486319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/04073e746da45eb29b30582abe5e2c97.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=156 /></span>Among the heroes Roy and Eria are of a special kind. not only you can switch between them at will but they can also save each other if their beloved is in danger !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Based !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/fa1eb08e8d6d48760ed08b5292078ab5.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is not\u00a0 just the field action but a fast paced turn based combat as well ! Even here each hero has different skills, spells and play style and when the Kyvedy Flame is lit it can unleash the <strong>Fireburn</strong> ! <br>The field combat and the turn based battles are intertwined and influence each other so that an ambush or a critical moment can be overturn by winning a battle.<br>\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/97b78b549da69295a4ce1018b62876c9.poster.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/97b78b549da69295a4ce1018b62876c9.webm?t=1761486319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/97b78b549da69295a4ce1018b62876c9.mp4?t=1761486319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore and fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/e4ebd92666de3c91e79d5ff0ce5e72ec.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <br>With the guilty pleasure of Skipping Cutscenes to see what happens..\u00a0 the game offers twice the story at the same price ! <br>While exploring you will find many books that will allow you to expand your knowledge, while not mandatory, there's plenty of Lore if you want to better understand the events of the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/6aedfc7fbeffee66ee630228f8a05a7e.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span>\u00a0<br><strong>Ten bad fates</strong> are there for you to discover while screwing up with many ways to die and unexpected ways to lose !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reaplayable !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/fb83866b1a864abe6eeca9326b09c6e8.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0  <br> The game offers High Replayability with secret feats, a Monster difficulty that let's you play a harder version of the level and adds handicaps to your heroes. Achievements to unlock and an extra &quot;Runner mode&quot; designed to test your speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Outstanding Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/a0a4b5c428ddd5240b97e9e7833a620f.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantastic soundtrack for an epic story, Fate of Fire boasts 42 tracks composed by the amazing <strong>Tim Beek</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/908cce5805fe02d2e7a39cddd3e70134.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic visuals</strong> with no frills from the modern era, one graphic setting designed to run on Next Gen Machines and Low End PCs <strong>with the same quality !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Preserved</strong>: This game is <strong>Anti-Alias free</strong>. Anti-Alias is never used during the rendering of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made with love.. with L\u00d6VE</strong>, the awesome 2d framework.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/30731bddf067f3a620579a3db0a1527d.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lengthy demo to introduce you to the story and let you taste the gameplay playing with five of the main characters. The demo is always updated with the latest features and your progress will be loaded in the full version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have fun Saving Humanity !   </strong>     <br><strong>Denis ^^</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/46828791b955e88ee55d3b38463e7a46.avif?t=1761486319\" width=74 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Sight of Guardiah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/70ff21b18765d7e03800adfe136e592be24974f1.jpg"},{"name":"A shared burden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/d5d96dd7ac0fb488cb1a04417f68f698c62ac733.jpg"},{"name":"Feat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/b0c64994cf8df3ff80e90141be37bf2702c8f975.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/e62095132af19aa006186ca8df5cf7d21a49062b.jpg"},{"name":"Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/a97ed903719cf3b733fbec503a0bd611058894f4.jpg"},{"name":"Deaf Man Walking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/7acea9bc7da55af123726a54971e2b5733780320.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/2f42241e4377495dcf285923e595415688c80183.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/4e92c84098bb5479213b05c803a0b3bc4db22f4d.jpg"},{"name":"The Fate Changer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/e2efed3bc489f6cb3c18b0fb9486f5f64f1966e0.jpg"},{"name":"A lesson in magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/4bde62896b6b8e85720dfe380bc92baa1fe04b48.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3085800?t=1761486319","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761486319","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/c9e604dc6ca35e5955fbed1a7ee025f40d25dc81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761486319","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/c9e604dc6ca35e5955fbed1a7ee025f40d25dc81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761486319","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3108270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\