"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/6aedfc7fbeffee66ee630228f8a05a7e.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span>\u00a0<br><strong>Ten bad fates</strong> are there for you to discover while screwing up with many ways to die and unexpected ways to lose !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reaplayable !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/fb83866b1a864abe6eeca9326b09c6e8.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0  <br> The game offers High Replayability with secret feats, a Monster difficulty that let's you play a harder version of the level and adds handicaps to your heroes. Achievements to unlock and an extra &quot;Runner mode&quot; designed to test your speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Outstanding Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/a0a4b5c428ddd5240b97e9e7833a620f.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantastic soundtrack for an epic story, Fate of Fire boasts 42 tracks composed by the amazing <strong>Tim Beek</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/908cce5805fe02d2e7a39cddd3e70134.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic visuals</strong> with no frills from the modern era, one graphic setting designed to run on Next Gen Machines and Low End PCs <strong>with the same quality !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Preserved</strong>: This game is <strong>Anti-Alias free</strong>. Anti-Alias is never used during the rendering of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made with love.. with L\u00d6VE</strong>, the awesome 2d framework.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/30731bddf067f3a620579a3db0a1527d.avif?t=1761486319\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lengthy demo to introduce you to the story and let you taste the gameplay playing with five of the main characters. The demo is always updated with the latest features and your progress will be loaded in the full version. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have fun Saving Humanity !   </strong>     <br><strong>Denis ^^</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/46828791b955e88ee55d3b38463e7a46.avif?t=1761486319\" width=74 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Denis Johan Tales"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/0fd8dee92c82e82d9704818cc3924c4a87403d2c/header.jpg?t=1761486319","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requ